Scope. The MIT license above covers the code in this repository (gsmsym/,
scripts/) and the text we wrote (documents, noop/clauses.jsonl).

Third-party material, which keeps its own license:
- GSM-Symbolic templates and generated data (Mirzadeh et al., Apple, 2024),
  CC BY-NC-ND 4.0, https://github.com/apple/ml-gsm-symbolic. Not vendored here;
  scripts/fetch_data.sh downloads it. Request logs (runs/*/requests.jsonl) quote
  unmodified items verbatim for reproducibility, with this attribution, for
  non-commercial research use. NoOp prompts, which would be adaptations, are
  logged only as SHA-256 hashes and rebuilt at run time.
- GSM8K (Cobbe et al., 2021), MIT, https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math.
- The 8-shot chain-of-thought exemplars (Wei et al., 2022) as distributed in
  EleutherAI lm-evaluation-harness (MIT).
- Model outputs in runs/ were produced by the listed providers' models; see
  README "Model output terms".
